{"t":"SPG","made":"2026-11-13 00:57","name":"Simon Property Group, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Retail","employees":3100,"hq":"Indianapolis, IN, United States","website":"https://www.simon.com","summary_en":"Simon Property Group, Inc. is a self-administered and self-managed real estate investment trust (REIT). Simon Property Group, L.P., or the Operating Partnership, is our majority-owned partnership subsidiary that owns all of our real estate properties and other assets. In this package, the terms Simon, we, our, or the Company refer to Simon Property Group, Inc., the Operating Partnership, and its subsidiaries. We own, develop and manage premier shopping, dining, entertainment and mixed-use destinations, which consist primarily of malls, Premium Outlets, The Mills, and International Properties. At December 31, 2024, we owned or had an interest in 229 properties comprising 183 million square feet in North America, Asia and Europe. We also owned an 88% interest in The Taubman Realty Group, or TRG, which owns 22 regional, super-regional, and outlet malls in the U.S. and Asia. Additionally, at December 31, 2024, we had a 22.4% ownership interest in Klepierre, a publicly traded, Paris-based real estate company, which owns shopping centers in 14 European countries. Simon Property Group, Inc. was incorporated in 1960 and is based in Indianapolis, Indiana.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Simon Property Group, Inc.는 자체 관리 및 자체 관리 부동산 투자 신탁(REIT)입니다. Simon Property Group, L.P. 또는 Operating Partnership은 당사의 모든 부동산 및 기타 자산을 소유한 대주주 파트너십 자회사입니다. 이 패키지에서 Simon, 당사 또는 회사라는 용어는 Simon Property Group, Inc., 운영 파트너십 및 그 자회사를 의미합니다. 우리는 주로 쇼핑몰, 프리미엄 아울렛, The Mills 및 International Properties로 구성된 최고의 쇼핑, 식사, 엔터테인먼트 및 복합 용도 장소를 소유, 개발 및 관리합니다. 2024년 12월 31일 기준으로 우리는 북미, 아시아 및 유럽에서 1억 8,300만 평방피트에 달하는 229개의 부동산을 소유하거나 지분을 보유하고 있습니다. 또한 우리는 미국과 아시아에서 22개의 지역, 초지역 및 아울렛 몰을 소유하고 있는 The Taubman Realty Group(TRG)의 지분 88%를 소유했습니다. 또한, 2024년 12월 31일에 우리는 유럽 14개국에 쇼핑 센터를 소유하고 있는 파리 소재 상장 부동산 회사인 Klepierre의 지분 22.4%를 보유하고 있습니다. Simon Property Group, Inc.는 1960년에 설립되었으며 인디애나주 인디애나폴리스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":234.245,"mcap":88669732864.0,"pe":16.912996,"fpe":34.549408,"peg":null,"ps":12.394932,"pb":18.673868,"ev_ebitda":19.993,"div":3.92,"beta":1.306,"hi52":238.5,"lo52":177.88},"fin":{"rev":7153709056.0,"rev_g":0.133,"eps_g":-0.171,"gross":0.81308,"op":0.4587,"net":0.6309,"roe":1.2519699,"fcf":2844865536.0,"cash":569940992.0,"debt":29213440000.0,"de":540.113,"eps":13.85,"feps":6.78},"own":{"short":0.0,"inst":0.95879996,"insider":0.01801},"analyst":{"n":19,"mean":233.86842,"median":229.0,"high":275.0,"low":207.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.47619,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":5,"hold":15,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":5,"hold":15,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":5,"hold":14,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":6,"hold":14,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-12","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"In-Line","FromGrade":"In-Line","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":227.0,"priorPriceTarget":225.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-11","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":235.0,"priorPriceTarget":205.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"In-Line","FromGrade":"In-Line","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":225.0,"priorPriceTarget":213.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-12","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":254.0,"priorPriceTarget":285.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-09","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":205.0,"priorPriceTarget":222.0},{"GradeDat